{"id": "8a159806-1528-49eb-8c02-86c21aad0e90", "role": "assistant", "block_type": "thinking", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Two distinct tasks here: a broad SageMaker security assessment, which is a survey-type job best handed to a sub-agent, and a narrower question about why a CreateTrainingJob call was denied yesterday. That second one points to an AccessDenied error in CloudTrail, so I should delegate to pull the actual CloudTrail event details.

